Native Seed Suppliers

Here is a list of seed suppliers and plant nurseries that sell plants which are indigenous to the region.  
The word "native" refers to plants that grow within 100-200 miles of the area to be planted.  
These plants have evolved over thousands of years as part of this region's ecosystem.  
For the MN DNR list of Southern Minnesota Native Plant Nurseries and Consultants, go to:
https://www.files.dnr.state.mn.us/assistance/backyard/gardens/native_plant/supplier-south.pdf

